    "body": "## Summary\n\n- reject missing and transient route-quote owners before parsing private route data\n- prevent unauthenticated service calls from spending external routing-provider budget\n- preserve the existing neutral not-found contract used by private quote reads and consumption\n- add regression coverage proving neither persistence nor the provider is reached\n- update the security contract and active 965-point audit status\n\n## Scope\n\n- 1 commit\n- 4 files\n- +32 / -2\n- base: `185e350ba14de5c6f2340f01448fac8ada9c9997`\n- head: `5e3c5f5f1c2115aaa5f0bf9f3e29ae6f0446aa11`\n\n## Validation\n\n- `git diff --check`\n- local and remote tree SHA match: `c685b0cbee9817845ffe5d11ee1d11459435c0e9`\n- merge only after all workflows for the exact head SHA are green and review threads are clear",
